automation.safetyBody:
1. Automation runs only on this machine and uses a visible browser, so you can watch it at any time;
2. EchoDesk never uploads task contents, downloaded files or generated results to any server;
3. Downloaded attachments are kept in the result folder for your review — check them for sensitive data before sharing;
4. You must confirm that this automation complies with your organisation's rules and the terms of service of the target site;
5. Consequences of misuse are borne by the user; Void Entropia Studio accepts no liability.
